case bad-roster-row-skipped
desc a bad row is skipped but counts toward BEGIN, so the good rows commit
recv system TBM:ROSTER_BEGIN|2
recv system TBM:ROSTER|101|Alpha|1|online|1|Elwynn Forest|-|Warrior
recv system TBM:ROSTER|x|Bravo|5|online|1|-|-|Priest
recv system TBM:ROSTER_END
expect roster.committed true
expect roster.count 1
expect problems.count 1
expect problem.0 bad-row
